# IsoRim animals batch small2 (blob style, bound 2026-11-16, branch animals6): Thrumbo (model-review\small2\out_v4), Capybara
# and Guinea pig (out_v2), Chinchilla (out_v1); generated by tools/make_small2_concept.py.
# Thrumbo: colours baked (vanilla draws it untinted). Capybara, chinchilla: white texture x the vanilla colour
# (tintFromGraphic; the concept's Kd held that colour for its review renders, here Kd = the lit white 0.96 as every
# tintFromGraphic animal). Guinea pig: white patches texture x the coat colour (tintFromGraphic for the base sprite's
# white / brown / grey, byBodyGraphic tints for GuineaPig1..3); blaze, muzzle and nose plain untinted materials.
newmtl an_thrumbo_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Thrumbo

newmtl an_capybara_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Capybara

